WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/onboarding/TourLauncher.tsx — a Modal (title "Take a tour") that lists every tour from the
  registry (lib/tourRegistry.ts → listTours, the 8 tours in TOUR_ORDER: main, vehicles, drives, charging,
  alerts, automations, settings, debugger). Regions:
    Modal[title t('tour.launcher.title')] → subtitle t('tour.launcher.subtitle')
       → <ul> of tours; each <li> = a bordered card:
            • completion icon box: <Check> (emerald) when isTourCompleted(def.id, def.version), else <PlayCircle>
            • title t(def.titleKey, def.titleFallback)
            • "Recommended for this page" chip (<Sparkles> + uppercase) when isRecommendedForRoute(def, pathname)
            • "Completed" chip (emerald uppercase) when completed
            • description t(def.descriptionKey, def.descriptionFallback)
            • action Button (variant primary when recommended else ghost) — label "Replay" when completed else
              "Start"; aria-label "Replay/Start tour: {{title}}"; on press: close + dispatchTourStart(def.id)
       → footer: "Reset all tours" (RotateCcw) text button + "Close" (X) Button.
  Data sources: useTranslation + useLocation only. No HTTP — local registry data + the per-tour completion flags
  in localStorage (teslasync:tour:v{version}:{id} → 'completed'|'skipped'; list-seen marker; resetAllTours clears
  every teslasync:tour: key + the legacy single flag). markTourListSeen() fires when the launcher opens.
  Route match (isRecommendedForRoute): string '/' = exact; other string = exact-or-`value/`-prefix; RegExp = test.

